      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The /uc links work on quest. However, all drive.google.com URLs including /uc and /file/d/.../view fail on PC due to bugs in yt-dlp ... the url it redirects to gives a 403 error.\nI tried to workaround the redirect but I was unable to .\nIt's a really frustrating situation because Google Drive is the only streaming service whitelisted by VRChat that runs on Quest and supports 60fps... but it's currently completely broken on PC. So I need completely different streaming services to support both PC and Quest.\nI would like to request that VRChat does not redirect /uc URLs. they can be played as is so no need for yt-dlp to corrupt them.\nAs for /file/d/.../view, it would be nice if yt-dlp could be patched to return the /uc?export=download&id= URL.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
